{"id":"776f51b54a824ba6","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-turing-join-lub.md","title":"Turing并是最小上界","display":"thm-turing-join-lub — Turing并是最小上界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-turing-join-lub","aliases":["43-thm-turing-join-lub"],"display":"thm-turing-join-lub — Turing并是最小上界","depends_on":["[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.4.1, print pp.13–15 / PDF pp.33–35","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-turing-join-lub"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-turing-join-lub</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-turing-join-lub — Turing并是最小上界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.4.1, print pp.13–15 / PDF pp.33–35"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B,C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>；集合按其特征序列识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_TA\\oplus B\\land B\\le_TA\\oplus B,\\qquad A\\oplus B\\le_TC\\leftrightarrow(A\\le_TC\\land B\\le_TC).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_TA\\oplus B\\land B\\le_TA\\oplus B,\\qquad A\\oplus B\\le_TC\\leftrightarrow(A\\le_TC\\land B\\le_TC).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>偶数位与奇数位分别恢复A与B；反向根据查询位置奇偶选择相应模拟。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.4.1, print pp.13–15 / PDF pp.33–35。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_T$ 与 $\\oplus$ 分别采用 [[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]；集合按其特征序列识别。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\le_T$ 与 $\\oplus$ 分别采用 [[43-df-turing-r